  "prefLabel": "We 401.04 Refusal of License Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 401.04 Refusal of License Renewal. The board shall deny an application for license renewal if the licensee fails to comply with this section and We 402, or if the board otherwise has good and sufficient reason to refuse to renew the license, as specified in RSA 482-B:8.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (formerly We 402.05) See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600",
